---

<Layout
  title={title}
  description={description}
  ogType="article"
  article={{
    publishedTime: dates.published,
    modifiedTime: dates.modified,
    author: authorName(Astro.url.pathname),
    section: "Home Improvement",
    tags: [
      "handheld vacuum",
      "best handheld vacuum",
      "hand vacuum",
      "dust buster",
      "cordless handheld vacuum",
      "best handheld vacuum for pet hair",
      "portable vacuum"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="bg-gray-900 py-16 lg:py-24 relative overflow-hidden">
      <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10" style="background-image: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 20%, #38BDF8 0, transparent 45%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 60%, #FF4500 0, transparent 40%);"></div>
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 relative z-10 text-center">
        <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
          <TrustBadge />
        </div>
        <div class="flex justify-center gap-3 mb-6">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#FF4500]/20 text-[#FF4500] text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest border border-[#FF4500]/30">
            Buyer's Guide
          </span>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/10 text-green-400 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest border border-green-500/20">
            Updated November 2026
          </span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black text-white leading-tight mb-8">
          Best <span class="text-[#38BDF8]">Handheld Vacuums</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-8 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Crumbs, pet hair, stairs and sofas: the jobs a full-size vacuum is too clumsy for. Seven handheld vacuums on Amazon, chosen by weight, brushes and how easy they are to grab every day.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 justify-center">
          <a
            href="#shark-ultracyclone-pet-pro-plus-ch951"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-[#FF4500] hover:bg-[#E63E00] text-white font-black rounded-xl shadow-lg transition-all no-underline"
          >
            See Our #1 Pick
          </a>
          <a
            href="#top-picks"
            class="px-8 py-4 bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white font-bold rounded-xl border border-white/10 no-underline"
          >
            What to Look For
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Author & Meta -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 pt-12">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6 border-b border-gray-100 pb-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <AuthorAvatar size={48} />
          <div>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Shaheer Ali Khan</p>
            <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-widest">Consumer Product Testing &amp; Materials Performance Specialist</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="h-10 w-px bg-gray-200 hidden sm:block"></div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900">Last Updated</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">{dates.display}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="hidden sm:block ml-auto">
          <SocialProof users="6.9k" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Table of Contents -->
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-10">
      <div class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 rounded-2xl p-6 lg:p-8">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-gray-900 mb-4 flex items-center gap-2">
          In This Guide
        </h2>
        <nav class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2">
          <a href="#what-matters" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">1. What to Look For</a>
          <a href="#types" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">2. Choosing the Type</a>
          <a href="#top-picks" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">3. The 7 Best Handheld Vacuums</a>
          <a href="#pet-hair" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">4. Best for Pet Hair</a>
          <a href="#stairs-upholstery" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">5. Stairs, Sofas and Mattresses</a>
          <a href="#wet-spills" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">6. Wet Spills</a>
          <a href="#battery" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">7. Battery and Charging</a>
          <a href="#vs-stick" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">8. Handheld vs Stick Vacuum</a>
          <a href="#maintenance" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">9. Keeping It Working</a>
          <a href="#small-spaces" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">10. Apartments and Small Homes</a>
          <a href="#budget" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">11. How Much to Spend</a>
          <a href="#mistakes" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">12. Common Mistakes</a>
          <a href="#faq" class="text-sm text-gray-600 hover:text-[#1E90FF] no-underline py-1 font-medium">13. FAQ</a>
