          </p>

          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-10 mb-4">Mattresses</h3>

          <p>
            The Shark WandVac includes a mattress tool for upholstery and pet hair. Vacuum mattresses slowly in overlapping passes when you change the sheets.
          </p>
        </div>

