              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What is the best handheld vacuum?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                For most homes, the Shark UltraCyclone Pet Pro Plus CH951 is the best handheld vacuum. Shark lists two cyclonic air streams for suction, it has a self-cleaning Pet Power Brush and an XL dust cup, and it weighs 2.8 lbs. The Shark WandVac is the best ultra-light pick at 1.4 lbs, and the BLACK+DECKER furbuster is the best budget choice for pet hair.
              </p>
